          default stays in effect; `config --set` refuses it (exit 3).
      ids.job = '{prefix}{hash}'   [default]
          Long-running job ids. Default {prefix}{hash}: J and ten hex digits. Tokens:
          {prefix} (the kind's letter), {seq} (next free number), {date}, {time},
          {pid}, {slug}, {hash} (salted, ten hex digits), {parent}, {phase}, {env},
          {user-text}, {digest} (stable content digest). A template needs {seq},
          {hash} or {time} with {pid}; one holding {digest} is stable and may hold
