          3).
      ids.session = 's{time}-{pid}'   [default]
          Session ids. Default s{time}-{pid}: s, the UTC time to the second, the
          process id. Tokens: {prefix} (the kind's letter), {seq} (next free number),
          {date}, {time}, {pid}, {slug}, {hash} (salted, ten hex digits), {parent},
